        <motion.div initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }} transition={{ duration: .7, ease: [0.23,1,.32,1] }} className="hero-copy">
          <div className="hero-kicker"><span className="live-dot"/> TRACE-BASED RELIABILITY / FOR AI THAT ACTUALLY ACTS</div>
          <h1>Make AI behavior<br/><span className="gradient-word">visible.</span><br/>Then make it <i>trustworthy.</i></h1>
          <p>TrustOps turns the hidden execution path of generative and agentic AI into evidence your team can inspect, evaluate, and defend.</p>
          <div className="hero-actions"><button onClick={() => go("overview")} className="hero-cta">Explore the Signal Room <ArrowUpRight size={16}/></button><a href="#workflow" className="hero-secondary">See how it works <ChevronRight size={14}/></a></div>
          <div className="hero-proof"><div><strong>3,038</strong><span>traces evaluated</span></div><div><strong>86.4%</strong><span>reliability score</span></div><div><strong>7</strong><span>investigation screens</span></div></div>
        </motion.div>
